
NEW_FILE_CODE
### FieldMappingController API 测试
### 使用 IntelliJ IDEA 或 VS Code 的 REST Client 插件运行

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8689/api/field-mapping

### 1. 健康检查接口
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. 基础字段映射处理 - 单个字段
POST {{baseUrl}}/process
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chineseNames": ["姓名"],
  "exportExcel": true,
  "generateVoCode": false
}

### 3. 批量字段映射处理 - 多个字段
POST {{baseUrl}}/process
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chineseNames": ["姓名", "年龄", "性别", "手机号码", "邮箱"],
  "exportExcel": true,
  "generateVoCode": true,
  "excelFileName": "用户信息字段映射",
  "voClassName": "UserFieldVO"
}

### 4. 字段映射处理 - 不导出 Excel 和生成代码
POST {{baseUrl}}/process
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chineseNames": ["地址", "邮编"],
  "exportExcel": false,
  "generateVoCode": false
}

### 5. 查询单个中文字段的映射
GET {{baseUrl}}/query/姓名

### 6. 查询单个中文字段的映射 - 年龄
GET {{baseUrl}}/query/年龄

### 7. 批量查询字段映射（逗号分隔）
GET {{baseUrl}}/query?chineseNames=姓名，年龄，性别

### 8. 批量查询字段映射 - 更多字段
GET {{baseUrl}}/query?chineseNames=手机号，邮箱，地址，城市

### 9. 错误测试 - 空的中文字段列表
POST {{baseUrl}}/process
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chineseNames": []
}

### 10. 错误测试 - null 的中文字段
POST {{baseUrl}}/process
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chineseNames": null
}

### 11. 复杂场景 - 包含可能重复的字段
POST {{baseUrl}}/process
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chineseNames": ["手机号", "手机号码", "电话", "固定电话"],
  "exportExcel": true,
  "generateVoCode": true,
  "excelFileName": "联系方式字段",
  "voClassName": "ContactVO"
}

### 12. 性能测试 - 大量字段
POST {{baseUrl}}/process
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chineseNames": ["姓名", "年龄", "性别", "民族", "国籍", "身份证号", "护照号", "出生日期", "出生地", "婚姻状况", "学历", "职业", "工作单位", "职位", "收入", "房产", "车辆", "存款", "保险", "社保"],
  "exportExcel": true,
  "generateVoCode": true,
  "excelFileName": "人员详细信息字段"
}

### 13. 自定义 VO 类名测试
POST {{baseUrl}}/process
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chineseNames": ["订单编号", "订单金额", "下单时间", "支付状态", "收货地址"],
  "exportExcel": false,
  "generateVoCode": true,
  "voClassName": "OrderInfoVO"
}

### 14. 仅导出 Excel 测试
POST {{baseUrl}}/process
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chineseNames": ["商品名称", "商品编码", "价格", "库存数量", "供应商"],
  "exportExcel": true,
  "generateVoCode": false,
  "excelFileName": "商品信息字段"
}

### 15. 仅生成 VO 代码测试
POST {{baseUrl}}/process
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chineseNames": ["用户名", "密码", "昵称", "头像", "签名"],
  "exportExcel": false,
  "generateVoCode": true,
  "voClassName": "UserProfileVO"
}